    "body": "Sorry, *newChildren* is not a `Document` but they are in an inert `Document` (the root element is an `html` element).\n\nThe minimal fix is probably to set the `DocumentFragment`'s node document to \"a new [Document](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#document) (whose [browsing context](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-document-bc) is null)\".",
